{"_id":"GwWl0RdXkUMSJVPv","name":"Mordre la poussière","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"Le personnage mord la poussière","results":[{"_id":"WX5AEl8XKQQKv9IL","type":0,"text":"Éraflure : le personnage s'en sort avec  une vilaine cicatrice.","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"pz2EkMq0xGX2HP22","type":0,"text":"Raté de peu : un des objets transporté  par le personnage est brisé.","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/chest.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"TdARqQ9EAtH7WHw2","type":0,"text":"Handicapé : Désavantage aux jets de  Dextérité jusqu'à la fin de la partie.","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/degen.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"MTywwGUSP513SNWe","type":0,"text":"Blessé : Désavantage à tous les jets  d'attributs jusqu'à la fin de la partie.","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"Zu2EUsNpX9elduHz","type":0,"text":"Amoché : le personnage perd 1 point  de Force ou de Dextérité de manière  permanente.","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"yMU3mEGEKC4rNmqf","type":0,"text":"Mort : créez un nouveau personnage  du même niveau que le personnage qui vient de décéder.","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null}],"formula":"1d6","replacement":true,"displayRoll":false,"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"RollTable.zJ2daaHsL3LmcmXI"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"c5EDQUsVVfPuU8L6":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"fleaux","systemVersion":"2022.3.02","coreVersion":"10.288","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1668014333623,"lastModifiedBy":"E0gf2VLNMstFJC5P"}}
{"_id":"HDDstVyyCBs3CZ7s","name":"Panique","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"Le personnage panique.","results":[{"_id":"Ni3g4wYrBPJBPGUB","type":0,"text":"Le personnage hurle pendant 1 Tour. Tous les personnages  proches doivent faire un jet de Volonté.","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"iyvveEgWsONmtDfl","type":0,"text":"Le personnage vomit et perd 1 PV.","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/waterfall.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"2H8dFo9WdBXZSIBM","type":0,"text":"Le personnage souffre de cécité hystérique jusqu'à la fin de son Tour suivant.","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/blind.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"aRS6yLdwjdouWSBM","type":0,"text":"Le personnage attaque quelqu'un au hasard . S'il n'y a aucune cible a proximité, il s'inflige d4  points de dégâts","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/combat.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"r9X0VQIgZnrau6Of","type":0,"text":"Le personnage a une crise cardiaque.","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"HCTRQ4LjFfIXwmzD","type":0,"text":"Le personnage reprend ses esprits et agit normalement.","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/cancel.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null}],"formula":"1d6","replacement":true,"displayRoll":false,"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"RollTable.OudKK79DPBKzdPP8"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"c5EDQUsVVfPuU8L6":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"fleaux","systemVersion":"2022.3.02","coreVersion":"10.288","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1668014302076,"lastModifiedBy":"E0gf2VLNMstFJC5P"}}
{"_id":"ToOsz4e8y8C50efh","name":"Revanche du Chaos","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"Si votre dé de Volonté est épuisé après avoir lancé un sort,\nvous devez faire face à une revanche du Chaos.","results":[{"_id":"cyQVXguoeGKyVRYD","type":0,"text":"Vous ne pouvez plus lancer de sort  jusqu’au prochain lever de soleil.","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/book.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"OJXQe8yqojINsKQl","type":0,"text":"L’énergie du sort ravage votre corps :  perdez d6 PV.","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/blood.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"0S1PBLteGkkCVi2z","type":0,"text":"Vous provoquez  une explosion d’énergie magique :  infligez d6 points de dégâts à toutes les personnes  proches.","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"r74Tr8dt5sILYV1E","type":0,"text":"Votre corps paye  le prix de votre arrogance : perdez  définitivement 1 PV.","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/downgrade.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"9ZRdUvwWOQNLEB9g","type":0,"text":"Votre esprit est consumé  par les horreurs de l’au-delà :  perdez 1 point de Sang-froid de manière  permanente.","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/terror.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null},{"_id":"dJrhWWUrdfZio0aA","type":0,"text":"Une créature  d’une autre dimension apparaît  et vous entraîne dans son domaine.","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/pawprint.svg","documentCollection":"","documentId":null}],"formula":"d6","replacement":true,"displayRoll":false,"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"RollTable.Gk87MyZFxFUqX1Hs"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"c5EDQUsVVfPuU8L6":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"fleaux","systemVersion":"2022.3.02","coreVersion":"10.288","create